@PaymentsModule_HostAddress = http://localhost:5150
@Token = <JWT con claim "sub" = id del cajero>

### Cobro mixto (efectivo + tarjeta)
POST {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/cobros
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dinning_session_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-1234-56789abcdef0",
  "detalles_snapshot": [
    {
      "nombre_platillo": "Corte Ribeye",
      "cantidad": 1,
      "precio_unitario": 500.00,
      "importe": 500.00
    }
  ],
  "pagos": [
    { "metodo_pago": "EFECTIVO", "monto": 200.00, "referencia_autorizacion": null },
    { "metodo_pago": "TARJETA_CREDITO", "monto": 300.00, "referencia_autorizacion": "AUTH-987654" }
  ]
}

### Detalle (ticket) por folio
GET {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/pagos/TX-20260929-001
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Historial de ventas (paginado)
GET {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/pagos?fecha_inicio=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z&fecha_fin=2026-09-30T23:59:59Z&estado=COMPLETADO&page_index=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Abrir caja
POST {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/caja/abrir
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fondo_inicial": 500.00 }

### Cerrar caja
POST {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/caja/cerrar
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "efectivo_declarado": 2500.00 }

###
